To build and install from source using makepkg:

    cd packaging/arch
    makepkg -si

To build without installing (inspect the package first):

    makepkg

To submit to the AUR, copy PKGBUILD to an AUR git repository:

    git clone ssh://aur@aur.archlinux.org/cacti-spine.git
    cp packaging/arch/PKGBUILD cacti-spine/
    cd cacti-spine && makepkg --printsrcinfo > .SRCINFO
    git add PKGBUILD .SRCINFO && git commit && git push
